{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>H2O Reminder Pro 是一款以動畫水杯呈現補水進度的 iOS 飲水提醒工具，適合經常忘記喝水、希望建立穩定補水習慣的上班族與學生。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可在 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>動畫水杯記錄飲水進度</h2>\n<p>開啟應用即見水杯動畫，隨著記錄逐步注滿，配合波浪效果與水滴音效，補水進度一目瞭然。輕點一下即可記錄飲水量，也可自訂 1.5L 至 3L 的每日目標，程式會在早上、下午與晚上適時提醒。內置 7 天紀錄與主畫面小工具，另支援 8 種語言，無需帳戶亦可離線使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-444-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-445-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-446-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-447-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-448-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-449-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：H2O Reminder Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T15:39:08.356007+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}